- `[Dedup] Dropping duplicate-by-originalText name="Date" originalText="10/09/2022"` (×1)
- `[Dedup] Dropping duplicate-by-originalText name="Date" originalText="03/03/2023"` (×2)

A separate spurious "PIN Code" → list-marker filter dropped 14 PIN codes that the new
deterministic extractor emitted (`770001`, `342007`, `342001`, `123456`, `342003`, `380001`).
The list-marker filter's heuristic likely tripped on bare-6-digit values it saw as section
labels — needs a follow-up to exempt the PIN extractor's hits.

